## seeds

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= new () : u32 * am'.vec u8 =\n    3u32, (([] : list u8) |> am'.new_vec)\n\n:= max_seeds () : convert.unativeint =\n    100i32 |> convert.convert\n\n:= trim_seeds (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8))) : am'.vec u8 =\n    := len : u64 = seeds |> am'.vec_ref_len |> convert.convert\n    := max : u64 = max_seeds () |> convert.convert\n    := excess = ? len > max ?> len - max |: 0u64\n    seeds |> am'.vec_drain_front (excess |> convert.convert)\n\n:= contribute_seed (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8))) (seed : am'.vec u8) : () =\n    := seed_len = seed |> am'.vec_len\n    seeds |> am'.vec_extend_from_slice seed\n    := seed_excess = seeds |> trim_seeds\n    trace Debug\n        \\ () => \"dice_contract.contribute_seed\"\n        \\ () => { seed_len seed_excess = seed_excess |> crypto.hex_of_vec }\n    trace_flush ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := new () : u32 * am'.vec u8 =
      3u32, (([] : list u8) |> am'.new_vec)

  := max_seeds () : convert.unativeint =
      100i32 |> convert.convert

  := trim_seeds (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8))) : am'.vec u8 =
      := len : u64 = seeds |> am'.vec_ref_len |> convert.convert
      := max : u64 = max_seeds () |> convert.convert
      := excess = ? len > max ?> len - max |: 0u64
      seeds |> am'.vec_drain_front (excess |> convert.convert)

  := contribute_seed (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8))) (seed : am'.vec u8) : () =
      := seed_len = seed |> am'.vec_len
      seeds |> am'.vec_extend_from_slice seed
      := seed_excess = seeds |> trim_seeds
      trace Debug
          \ () => "dice_contract.contribute_seed"
          \ () => { seed_len seed_excess = seed_excess |> crypto.hex_of_vec }
      trace_flush ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

