## generate_random_number

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= generate_random_number\n    (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8)))\n    (key : sm'.std_string)\n    (proof : sm'.std_string)\n    (max : u64)\n    : u64\n    =\n    := call = { key = key |> sm'.from_std_string; proof = proof |> sm'.from_std_string; seeds = seeds |> am'.vec_ref_to_array }\n    ?= generate host call max ?|\n    | Rolled (value, e, digest) =>\n        seeds |> am'.vec_extend_from_array digest\n        seeds |> trim_seeds |> ignore\n        trace Debug\n            \\ () => \"dice_contract.generate_random_number \" ++# entropy_text e ++# \"; hash = \" ++# bytes.hex digest\n            \\ () => { max result = value }\n        trace_flush ()\n        value\n\n:= roll_within_bounds (max : u64) (rolls : am'.vec u8) : optionm'.option' u64 =\n    := result =\n        rolls\n        |> am'.from_vec_base\n        |> am'.to_list_base'\n        |> listm'.unbox\n        |> lib.dice.roll_within_bounds max\n        |> optionm'.box\n    trace Debug\n        \\ () => \"dice_contract.roll_within_bounds\"\n        \\ () => { max rolls = #?*rolls; result = #?*result }\n    trace_flush ()\n    result","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := generate_random_number
      (seeds : rust.ref (rust.mut' (am'.vec u8)))
      (key : sm'.std_string)
      (proof : sm'.std_string)
      (max : u64)
      : u64
      =
      := call = { key = key |> sm'.from_std_string; proof = proof |> sm'.from_std_string; seeds = seeds |> am'.vec_ref_to_array }
      ?= generate host call max ?|
      | Rolled (value, e, digest) =>
          seeds |> am'.vec_extend_from_array digest
          seeds |> trim_seeds |> ignore
          trace Debug
              \ () => "dice_contract.generate_random_number " ++# entropy_text e ++# "; hash = " ++# bytes.hex digest
              \ () => { max result = value }
          trace_flush ()
          value

  := roll_within_bounds (max : u64) (rolls : am'.vec u8) : optionm'.option' u64 =
      := result =
          rolls
          |> am'.from_vec_base
          |> am'.to_list_base'
          |> listm'.unbox
          |> lib.dice.roll_within_bounds max
          |> optionm'.box
      trace Debug
          \ () => "dice_contract.roll_within_bounds"
          \ () => { max rolls = #?*rolls; result = #?*result }
      trace_flush ()
      result
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

